{"step_index":424,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T07:10:37Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-26T14:10:37+07:00\nCompleted At: 2026-08-26T14:10:37+07:00\nFile Path: `file:///c:/Demo.plane/js/character-renderer.js`\nTotal Lines: 222\nTotal Bytes: 9766\nShowing lines 1 to 60\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: /**\n2:  * character-renderer.js - Character State Renderer for Bé Bin\n3:  * Chuẩn Style BIN_SOFT_STORYBOOK_2D_V1\n4:  * - Level 1: Hệ Layer trong suốt (Base + Shirt + Pants + Shoes) đứng trực tiếp trong phòng (không khung card trắng)\n5:  * - Level 2-8: Duy trì trạng thái và chuyển đổi Pose artwork 2D Storybook chính xác\n6:  */\n7: \n8: class CharacterRenderer {\n9:     constructor() {\n10:         // State ban đầu của Bé Bin: ban đầu Level 1 chưa mặc đồ ngoài (chưa chọn)\n11:         this.characterState = {\n12:             outfit: {\n13:                 shirt: null,  // 'soft' | null\n14:                 pants: null,  // 'soft' | null\n15:                 shoes: null   // 'velcro' | null\n16:             },\n17:             pose: 'standing', // 'standing' | 'pointing' | 'seated' | 'drinking_water' | 'looking_window' | 'whispering' | 'sitting_neat' | 'holding_badge'\n18:             expression: 'normal',\n19:             seatbelt: 'none', // 'none' | 'open' | 'fastened'\n20:             holding: null\n21:         };\n22: \n23:         // Bảng ánh xạ Asset Layer và Artwork Storybook 2D\n24:         this.assetManifest = {\n25:             layers: {\n26:                 baseBody: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/bin_base.svg',\n27:                 shirtSoft: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shirts/shirt_soft.svg',\n28:                 pantsSoft: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/pants/pants_soft.svg',\n29:                 shoesVelcro: 'assets/characters/bin/dress/shoes/shoes_velcro.svg'\n30:             },\n31:             storybookPoses: {\n32:                 standing: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_point_right_1787725750609.jpg',\n33:                 pointing: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_point_right_1787725750609.jpg',\n34:                 seated_open: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_seated_plane_1787725580022.jpg',\n35:                 seated_fastened: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_seatbelt_fastened_1787725612313.jpg',\n36:                 drinking_water: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_drink_water_1787725639196.jpg',\n37:                 looking_window: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_looking_window_1787725671427.jpg',\n38:                 whispering: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_whisper_sitting_1787725691994.jpg',\n39:                 sitting_neat: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_whisper_sitting_1787725691994.jpg',\n40:                 holding_badge: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_holding_badge_1787725718575.jpg'\n41:             }\n42:         };\n43: \n44:         this.init();\n45:     }\n46: \n47:     init() {\n48:         this.updateAll();\n49:     }\n50: \n51:     // ==========================================================================\n52:     // PUBLIC STATE API (GỌI TỪ GAMEPLAY CONTROLLER)\n53:     // ==========================================================================\n54: \n55:     setShirt(value) {\n56:         this.characterState.outfit.shirt = value;\n57:         this.updateAll();\n58:     }\n59: \n60:     setPants(value) {\nThe above content does NOT show the entire file contents. If you need to view any lines of the file which were not shown to complete your task, call this tool again to view those lines.\n"}
{"step_index":425,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-26T07:10:37Z","thinking":"**Considering Bé Bin's Art**\n\nI'm now thinking about Level 1. Instead of using procedural SVG layers for the assets, like the current `bin_base.svg` from the assets, I believe we should use the master artwork of Bé Bin. I will integrate this approach now. The system should adjust when the child selects soft items.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"/**\n * character-renderer.js - Character State Renderer for Bé Bin\n * 100% Sử dụng Master Storybook 2D Artwork thật (BIN_SOFT_STORYBOOK_2D_V1)\n * Tuyệt đối không dùng SVG procedural primitives để dựng nhân vật\n */\n\nclass CharacterRenderer {\n    constructor() {\n        // State nhân vật\n        this.characterState = {\n            outfit: {\n                shirt: 'soft',\n                pants: 'soft',\n                shoes: 'velcro'\n            },\n            pose: 'standing',\n            expression: 'normal',\n            seatbelt: 'none',\n            holding: null\n        };\n\n        // Bảng ánh xạ Artwork Storybook 2D Thật\n        this.assetManifest = {\n            storybookPoses: {\n                standing: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_point_right_1787725750609.jpg',\n                pointing: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_point_right_1787725750609.jpg',\n                seated_open: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_seated_plane_1787725580022.jpg',\n                seated_fastened: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_seatbelt_fastened_1787725612313.jpg',\n                drinking_water: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_drink_water_1787725639196.jpg',\n                looking_window: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_looking_window_1787725671427.jpg',\n                whispering: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_whisper_sitting_1787725691994.jpg',\n                sitting_neat: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_whisper_sitting_1787725691994.jpg',\n                holding_badge: 'file:///C:/Users/USER/.gemini/antigravity/brain/6f49409f-fe23-4490-984d-4f0e771339c6/bin_holding_badge_1787725718575.jpg'\n            }\n        };\n\n        this.init();\n    }\n\n    init() {\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // PUBLIC STATE API (GỌI TỪ GAMEPLAY CONTROLLER)\n    // ==========================================================================\n\n    setShirt(value) {\n        this.characterState.outfit.shirt = value;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setPants(value) {\n        this.characterState.outfit.pants = value;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setShoes(value) {\n        this.characterState.outfit.shoes = value;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setPose(poseName) {\n        this.characterState.pose = poseName;\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setSeatbelt(seatbeltState) {\n        this.characterState.seatbelt = seatbeltState; // 'none' | 'open' | 'fastened'\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    setHolding(item) {\n        this.characterState.holding = item;\n        if (item === 'water') {\n            this.setPose('drinking_water');\n        } else if (item === 'badge') {\n            this.setPose('holding_badge');\n        } else {\n            this.updateAll();\n        }\n    }\n\n    reset() {\n        this.characterState = {\n            outfit: { shirt: 'soft', pants: 'soft', shoes: 'velcro' },\n            pose: 'standing',\n            expression: 'normal',\n            seatbelt: 'none',\n            holding: null\n        };\n        this.updateAll();\n    }\n\n    // ==========================================================================\n    // RENDER ENGINE\n    // ==========================================================================\n\n    renderTo(containerEl, customMode = null, customSeatbelt = null) {\n        if (!containerEl) return;\n\n        const effectivePose = customMode || this.characterState.pose;\n        const effectiveSeatbelt = customSeatbelt !== null ? customSeatbelt : this.characterState.seatbelt;\n\n        let poseKey = effectivePose;\n        if (effectivePose === 'seated') {\n            poseKey = effectiveSeatbelt === 'fastened' ? 'seated_fastened' : 'seated_open';\n        }\n\n        const poseSrc = this.assetManifest.storybookPoses[poseKey] || this.assetManifest.storybookPoses.standing;\n\n        containerEl.innerHTML = '';\n        containerEl.classList.add('bin-character-frame');\n\n        const wrapper = document.createElement('div');\n        wrapper.className = 'bin-layered-stack';\n\n        const poseImg = document.createElement('img');\n        poseImg.className = 'bin-layer bin-layer-pose pop-in-soft';\n        poseImg.src = poseSrc;\n        poseImg.style.borderRadius = '24px';\n        poseImg.alt = `Bé Bin ${effectivePose}`;\n        wrapper.appendChild(poseImg);\n\n        containerEl.appendChild(wrapper);\n    }\n\n    updateAll() {\n        // 1. Mount point Level 1: Bé Bin đứng trực tiếp trong phòng\n        const lvl1Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl1');\n        if (lvl1Mount) this.renderTo(lvl1Mount, 'standing');\n\n        // 2. Mount point Level 3 Cổng An Ninh\n        const lvl3Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl3');\n        if (lvl3Mount) this.renderTo(lvl3Mount, 'pointing');\n\n        // 3. Mount point Level 5 Ghế Ngồi Khoang Bay\n        const lvl5Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl5');\n        if (lvl5Mount) {\n            const pose5 = this.characterState.pose === 'drinking_water' ? 'drinking_water' : 'seated';\n            this.renderTo(lvl5Mount, pose5, this.characterState.seatbelt);\n        }\n\n        // 4. Mount point Level 6 Nhìn Cửa Sổ\n        const lvl6Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl6');\n        if (lvl6Mount) this.renderTo(lvl6Mount, 'looking_window');\n\n        // 5. Mount point Level 7 Lịch Sự\n        const lvl7Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl7');\n        if (lvl7Mount) {\n            const pose7 = this.characterState.pose === 'whispering' ? 'whispering' : (this.characterState.pose === 'sitting_neat' ? 'sitting_neat' : 'seated');\n            this.renderTo(lvl7Mount, pose7, 'fastened');\n        }\n\n        // 6. Mount point Level 8 Nhận Thưởng\n        const lvl8Mount = document.getElementById('bin-character-mount-lvl8');\n        if (lvl8Mount) {\n            const pose8 = this.characterState.pose === 'holding_badge' ? 'holding_badge' : 'standing';\n            this.renderTo(lvl8Mount, pose8);\n        }\n    }\n}\n\n// Khởi tạo instance toàn cục\nwindow.binRenderer = new CharacterRenderer();\n","Description":"Cập nhật character-renderer.js dùng 100% Storybook 2D artwork thật không procedural SVG","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"c:\\Demo.plane\\js\\character-renderer.js","toolAction":"Writing file","toolSummary":"Update character-renderer.js to 100% real artwork"}}]}
